 CPFBLKTAP    = T              /   Block tap control                                                                                   
 CPFDSCRTAP   = F              /   Enable discrete tap                                                                                 
 CPFBLKSHFT   = T              /   Block phase shifter control                                                                         
 CPFAREACNTRL = F              /   Enable area interchange control                                                                     
 CPFCHSSWING  = T              /   Auto-selection of swing Bus for contingency generated islands                                       
 CPFDSTSLACK  = F              /   Distributed slack                                                                                   
 CPFCURRATING = T              /   Voltage dependent MVA thermal limit (current)                                                       
