 TDSBLKCOMMF  = F              /   Block natural commutation failure                                                                   
 TDSADJSMMVA  = F              /   Adjust synchronous machine model MVA to power flow data                                             
 TDSINFNORM   = F              /   LTE and convergency based on infinite norm                                                          
 TDSDFLTUEL   = F              /   Setup default UEL if not specified
 TDSLMTGOV    = F              /   Limit governors output to 1 pu at machine nominal power
 TDSSIMPLOT   = F              /   Plot graphics during simulation, instead of at the end of simulation
 TDSBLKAVR    = F              /   Block all AVR models?                                                                               
